## Codex for OSS Form Text

### Why does this repository qualify?

Machine-tool troubleshooting is underserved in OSS. This repo provides an open, lightweight diagnostic intake template for small manufacturers, repair technicians, and used-machine buyers to structure symptoms, photos/videos, and repair context before expert review. It is early-stage but actively maintained and aims to make industrial maintenance knowledge more accessible.

### How will you use API credits for your project?

I will use API credits to add Codex-powered maintainer workflows: generating issue templates from user feedback, reviewing changes to the static diagnostic form, improving Japanese/English troubleshooting content, and prototyping AI-assisted summaries that turn symptom notes into structured repair handoff reports.

### Anything else we should know?

This is an early-stage OSS project from a manufacturing and repair context. The goal is to turn practical machine-tool troubleshooting knowledge into reusable public templates and workflows for small shops that do not have easy access to expert diagnosis.
